    "system": {
        "id": "flamestance",
        "type": "path",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Two Actions\" aria-label=\"Two Actions\">1</span></p><p><em>You enter an aggressive, squared stance that favors swift flurries of decisive blows.</em></p><p>While in this stance, you gain an advantage on <strong>Intimidation</strong> tests. Additionally, while there is exactly one enemy within your reach and none of your allies are within the reach of that enemy or you, you can use <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Two Actions\" aria-label=\"Two Actions\">0</span> to gain <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Two Actions\" aria-label=\"Two Actions\">1</span>, which you can spend only to @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.actions.Item.8yQ5MMIrywehKyTS]{Gain Advantage} or use an action that includes an attack test targeting that enemy.</p>",
            "chat": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Two Actions\" aria-label=\"Two Actions\">1</span></p><p>Enter Flamestance: You gain an advantage on <strong>Intimidation</strong>, and when only one enemy is in reach and no allies are, gain <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Two Actions\" aria-label=\"Two Actions\">1</span> to attack or @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.actions.Item.8yQ5MMIrywehKyTS]{Gain Advantage}.</p>",
            "short": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Two Actions\" aria-label=\"Two Actions\">1</span></p><p>While in this stance, you gain an advantage on <strong>Intimidation</strong> tests. Additionally, while there is exactly one enemy within your reach and none of your allies are within the reach of that enemy or you, you can use <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Two Actions\" aria-label=\"Two Actions\">0</span> to gain <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Two Actions\" aria-label=\"Two Actions\">1</span>, which you can spend only to @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.actions.Item.8yQ5MMIrywehKyTS]{Gain Advantage} or use an action that includes an attack test targeting that enemy.</p>"
        },
